R represents a straight- or branched-chain alkyl group containing up to six carbon atoms which is optionally substituted by one or more halogen atoms; or a straight- or branched-chain alkenyl or alkynyl group containing 

from two to six (preferably from three to six) carbon atoms which is optionally substituted by one or more halogen atoms; 

